Practical Exercise 1 — Contact Form
Create a contact form containing:
•	Full Name 
•	Email 
•	Phone 
•	Subject 
•	Message 
•	Submit button 
•	Reset button 
Requirements:
•	Every field must have a label 
•	Use appropriate input types. 
•	Use required. 
•	Use meaningful id and name values.


